8-earnings-conferen.aspx"},{"c":"LSTR 2020 Q1","e":"lstr","d":"2020-04-23","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Jim B. Gattoni","x":"I mean, clearly, this has disrupted their supply chains and our agents are in constant contact with them along with some our employees.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/04/23/landstar-system-inc-lstr-q1-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"LSTR 2020 Q2","e":"lstr","d":"2020-07-23","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Jim B. Gattoni","x":"As it pertains to the Company's transportation network, we expected that the sudden decrease in demand in late March caused by industry closures and shelter at home orders would result in the disruption in the daily routines of many of our Company's BCOs and agents.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/23/landstar-system-inc-lstr-q2-2020-earnings-call-tra.aspx"},{"c":"LSTR 2020 Q3","e":"lstr","d":"2020-10-22","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Kevin Stout","x":"During the 2020 third quarter, 140% of the increase in gross profit from the 2019 third quarter was passed through to operating income.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/22/landstar-system-inc-lstr-q3-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"LSTR 2020 Q4","e":"lstr","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim B. Gattoni","x":"However, as it relates to full year 2021, certain costs and cost savings that took place in 2020 mostly due to the COVID-19 pandemic are not expected to occur.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/landstar-system-inc-lstr-q4-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"LSTR 2020 Q4","e":"lstr","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jim B. Gattoni","x":"The company also estimates that it had cost savings due to cancellation of events, travel and entertainment, BCO training and recruiting costs, and various other savings totaled about $7 million in 2020.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/landstar-system-inc-lstr-q4-2020-earnings-call-tra/"},{"c":"LSTR 2025 Q2","e":"lstr","d":"2025-07-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Daniel Imbro","x":"It's kinda powering that whole infrastructure build with AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/landstar-lstr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSTR 2025 Q2","e":"lstr","d":"2025-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Frank Lonegro","x":"I would continue to see auto as being something that is a bit sluggish until we see interest rates and tariffs find their equilibrium.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/landstar-lstr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSTR 2025 Q2","e":"lstr","d":"2025-07-29","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Frank Lonegro","x":"Then we probably had some tariff pull forwards in the first half of the year, which probably gave it a little bit of bid.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/08/05/landstar-lstr-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSTR 2025 Q3","e":"lstr","d":"2025-10-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"James Todd","x":"We experienced strong demand related to AI infrastructure projects, which is reflected in part in both our electrical and machinery commodity categories, while strong demand for our services and support of wind energy projects drove the strength in our energy commodity grouping.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/landstar-lstr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSTR 2025 Q3","e":"lstr","d":"2025-10-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"James Todd","x":"We also continue to invest in and develop multiple in-flight AI-enabled products within our portfolio of digital tools in support of our network of agents, capacity providers and employees.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/landstar-lstr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSTR 2025 Q3","e":"lstr","d":"2025-10-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Frank Lonegro","x":"You got the tariffs this year, which -- maybe there's a little pull forward there, maybe some disruption on the back end here.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/landstar-lstr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSTR 2025 Q3","e":"lstr","d":"2025-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"James Todd","x":"…in the current report on Form 8-K filed with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission on August 13, 2025, the company conducted a strategic review of our operations during the 2025 third quarter focused on efforts to streamline our core operations and position the company for future growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/landstar-lstr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSTR 2025 Q3","e":"lstr","d":"2025-10-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"J. Bruce Chan","x":"Wondering if there are any identifiable cost savings that come out of that project or program?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/29/landstar-lstr-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSTR 2025 Q4","e":"lstr","d":"2026-01-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"unknown","s":"Unidentified Speaker","x":"As we continue our efforts to find new ways to embed AI in our business, I'm pleased to report that approximately 50% of our IT CapEx budget for 2026 is dedicated to AI enablement and solutions.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/landstar-lstr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSTR 2025 Q4","e":"lstr","d":"2026-01-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"unknown","s":"Unidentified Speaker","x":"We -- we continue to invest through the cycle in leading technology and AI solutions for the benefit of our network of independent business owners and have allocated a significant amount of capital this year towards refreshing our fleet of trailing equipment with a particular focus on investment…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/landstar-lstr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSTR 2025 Q4","e":"lstr","d":"2026-01-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Frank Lonegro","x":"…be noted that we faced a challenging year-over-year truck volume comparison during the first quarter as 2025 first quarter truck volumes exceeded the immediately preceding fourth quarter truck volumes for the first time in 15 years, with tariff pull-forward behavior likely driving the strength.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/29/landstar-lstr-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSTR 2026 Q1","e":"lstr","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Frank A. Lonegro","x":"We continue to invest through the cycle in leading technology and AI solutions for the benefit of our network of independent business owners and have allocated a significant amount of capital this year towards refreshing our fleet of trailer equipment with a particular focus on investment in new…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/landstar-lstr-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LSTR 2026 Q1","e":"lstr","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Brian Patrick Ossenbeck","x":"So a little bit more specifics on that, including—you talked about the CapEx budget here, AI being about half of the IT capital budget, but what is also running through the expense line there?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/landstar-lstr-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LSTR 2026 Q1","e":"lstr","d":"2026-04-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Frank A. Lonegro","x":"We also continue to monitor the potential effect of tariff and trade policy on our business, including the impact of the recent Supreme Court decision and tariff refunds from the federal government.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/landstar-lstr-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LSTR 2026 Q1","e":"lstr","d":"2026-04-28","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Frank A. Lonegro","x":"Tariffs have certainly already impacted freight flows.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/landstar-lstr-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LSTR 2026 Q1","e":"lstr","d":"2026-04-28","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Frank A. Lonegro","x":"We are driving to incorporate AI into our business and do everything we can to mitigate any perceived industry-specific AI disintermediation risk.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/04/28/landstar-lstr-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"LSTR 2026 Q3","e":"lstr","d":"2026-10-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Frank Lonegro","x":"We continue to invest through the cycle in leading technology and AI solutions for the benefit of our network of independent business owners and have allocated a significant amount of capital this year towards refreshing our fleet of trailing equipment, with a particular focus on investing in new…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/landstar-lstr-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"LSTR 2026 Q3","e":"lstr","d":"2026-10-27","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jim Todd","x":"While the heavy haul service offering has certainly been helped out from some AI data center type demand, we had 22 customers in that vertical grow their heavy haul volumes at Landstar by at least 50 loads in the quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/10/28/landstar-lstr-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,6324,0,0,0,5028,814],[36,1,8446,0,0,0,5936,1896],[37,1,8484,0,0,0,5886,2057],[38,1,6681,0,0,0,4678,1526],[39,1,11370,0,0,0,8012,2662],[40,1,9539,0,0,0,7142,1826],[41,1,10072,0,0,0,7599,1878],[42,1,10197,0,0,0,8028,1599],[43,1,9490,0,0,0,7401,1597],[44,1,11929,0,0,0,9165,2200],[45,1,7244,0,0,0,5676,1152],[46,1,9411,0,0,0,7224,1685],[47,1,10295,0,0,0,8587,1273],[62,1,7671,0,0,0,6038,1189],[63,1,8810,0,0,0,7637,926],[64,